  "description": "Per-site health for essexcrossingatmontserrat.com (ECS service solidago-dev-pondview on the shared Solidago platform). NOTE: essexcrossingatmontserrat.com is a second public hostname of the lentago/site-pondviewlane-com repo — both domains are served by the same nginx container and the same ECS service (solidago-dev-pondview). The Traffic/Runtime rows therefore show identical data to site-pondviewlane-com; that is correct and expected, not a copy-paste error. The Status row (blackbox probes) is domain-specific: a TLS certificate gap, a DNS regression, or an ALB listener rule change that affects only this hostname will appear here and not on the pondviewlane.com dashboard. Status row: outside-in blackbox probes from the lab Alloy (Mimir). Traffic/runtime rows: query-on-demand CloudWatch — every render bills GetMetricData; overnight gaps are the nightly DR teardown drill. ALB panels use SEARCH expressions on stable name fragments because TargetGroup/LoadBalancer dimension hashes rotate on the nightly rebuild. Refresh floor is 5m.",
